---@alias gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.MediationGroupMediationAbExperimentStateEnum "EXPERIMENT_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"RUNNING"|"NOT_RUNNING"

---Settings for an ad network used by a mediation group.
---@class gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.MediationGroupMediationGroupLine
---@field adSourceId? string The ID of the ad source this mediation line is associated with.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.MediationGroupMediationGroupLineStateEnum|string The status of the mediation group line. Only enabled mediation group lines will be served.
---@field experimentVariant? gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.MediationGroupMediationGroupLineExperimentVariantEnum|string Output only. The Mediation A/B experiment variant to which the mediation group line belongs to.
---@field cpmMode? gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.MediationGroupMediationGroupLineCpmModeEnum|string Indicates how the CPM for this mediation line is provided. Note that `MANUAL` and `LIVE` are the only fully-supported mode at the moment. Please use the AdMob UI (https://admob.google.com) if you wish to create or update to other cpm modes.
