---@field adUnitMappings? gcp.unstable.admob_v1beta.StringMap References of the ad unit mappings for each ad unit associated with this mediation line. Key is the ad unit ID, value is resource name of the ad unit mapping. For mediation lines where the ad source id is the AdMob Network, ad unit mappings will be ignored.

